Houston, if you caught Kev Adams’ English stand-up audition on *America’s Got Talent* this year, see what he does with a full room.

@kevadams has been doing stand-up since 2009. His style is personal and observant, with stories about love, success, and growing up in public. His Netflix special, *Kev Adams: The Real Me*, gives you the feel. Live is the better way to spend the night.

Houston Improv · Wednesday, November 11, 2026

Tickets are in the link in bio. Tag the person you’d bring.

